Cell["\<\
A successful input check prints PASS. This verifies the CSV inputs and \
plotting requirements; it does not replace the numerical Maxwell SelfTest or \
an interval-certificate verification.\
\>", "Text"],

Cell["\<\
Each panel has an independent legend-width setting immediately before its \
figure command. Automatic preserves the current appearance. Replace Automatic \
with a fraction such as 0.55 to use 55% of that panel's plot width, subject \
to the existing margins. Evaluate the edited setting cell, then the figure \
command. A single-panel figure uses panel a. Settings for panels without \
legends have no effect. Box-width changes do not wrap or resize the legend \
text.\
\>", "Text"]
}, Open  ]],

