Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Repeating or adjusting the plots", "Section"],

Cell["\<\
Once loading and the data check have succeeded, re-evaluate an individual \
mcfFigure[n] cell to replot and export only that figure. The command \
mcfRunAll[] repeats all ten. Re-evaluate mcfInitialize[NotebookDirectory[]] \
if the CSV files change. Save the notebook after evaluation to retain the \
displayed figures.\
\>", "Text"],

Cell["\<\
Colors and font sizes are declared near the beginning of the embedded source. \
Source edits take effect after re-evaluating the loader, initialization and \
check cells. Existing PDFs with matching names in clean_figures are replaced; \
the input CSVs remain unchanged.\
\>", "Text"],

Cell["\<\
Only eleven primary CSV files are used. The extended-asymptotic, \
candidate-count, higher-multipole and certificate files are not plotting \
inputs.\
\>", "Text"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
